n style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．渗析</span></p></td><td style=\"width:100px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．蒸发</span></p></td><td style=\"width:149px;border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px;border-style:solid solid solid solid;border-color:black;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．丁达尔效应</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span></span></p><div class=\" qml-og\"><table class=\"qml-og\" style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td>A.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span></span></td><td>B.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">B</span></span></td><td>C.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">C</span></span></td><td colspan=\"1\">D.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">D</span></span></td></tr></table></div></div>",
  "answer": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-answer\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861847-114651791852237200-Jq8sMjzNw_Ja73p0R2S-0tm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXokU2OZBd_QyQhv79Mo3QhX\"><span class=\"qml-an-sq\"><span class=\"qml-an qml-isop \">C</span></span></div>",
  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861847-114651791852237200-Jq8sMjzNw_Ja73p0R2S-0tm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXokU2OZBd_QyQhv79Mo3QhX\"><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"详解\">【详解】<p style=\"\"><span>A．过滤利用浊液中分散质粒子直径大于滤纸孔隙无法透过滤纸，而溶液、胶体的分散质粒子可透过滤纸的原理分离物质，与粒子直径大小有直接关系，A不符合题意；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>B．渗析利用胶体分散质粒子直径大于半透膜孔隙无法透过半透膜，而溶液中的小分子、离子可透过半透膜的原理提纯胶体，与粒子直径大小有直接关系，B不符合题意；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>C．蒸发是利用溶剂沸点低于溶质，加热使溶剂挥发从而分离溶质与溶剂，与粒子直径大小没有直接关系，C符合题意；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>D．丁达尔效应是由于胶体分散质粒子直径在1~100nm之间，可对光线产生散射作用，而溶液分散质粒子直径过小无明显散射现象，与粒子直径大小有直接关系，D不符合题意；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>故选C。</span></p></div></div>",
